      "params": {
        "text": "Blending colours\n\n`color/lerp` mixes two colours by t ∈ [0, 1]. sin(time)*0.5+0.5 oscillates t between 0 and 1, so the fill colour smoothly slides between magenta and cyan and back.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 200
      },
